{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to clear out massive waves of super ultra-mega-hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle lasts about 15 minutes \u2013 perfect for quick sessions anytime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/fca83ddafcbb5aee0ccdfb40bd1bd7d1.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/fca83ddafcbb5aee0ccdfb40bd1bd7d1.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors will automatically attack enemies. Each kill grants XP. When they level up, you'll get enhancement cards to strengthen your warriors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/65e725c9d29b04d4801516e8ab220668.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/65e725c9d29b04d4801516e8ab220668.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors have synergies \u2013 for example, if you unlock the &quot;Energy Sense&quot; ability, magic waves will trigger a ring of smaller magic waves upon contacting electromagnetic fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics drop during combat, and powerful ones will significantly boost your firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/073b0a642cd224e50edcdede5df6f13c.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/073b0a642cd224e50edcdede5df6f13c.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters have specific weaknesses or traits. Exploiting these vulnerabilities allows more efficient elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/9bf6c12e7113320aad836574e270ccfb.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/9bf6c12e7113320aad836574e270ccfb.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and experience the battlefield in person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Entering the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703380/740d9c661cd732d08a3b25ddc3723d4c154c5a5d.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh Start II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703380/97d2ccfaa2bd4e2bdcf04623e634efadf1d89304.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Slayer I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703380/70e228709e33b98c47c6a8b8625acbc43a41c75d.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Slayer II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703380/07db77f4f6927770b5a5f0aaff883389ba8ff6a3.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Slayer III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703380/9d4e22a89c56afe0263cd9c798c24706a8d0f122.jpg"},{"name":"Frenzied Output I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703380/dc7fd618818a7e098e37342bcae6d3b31cdbd3e0.jpg"},{"name":"Frenzied Output II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703380/dc7fd618818a7e098e37342bcae6d3b31cdbd3e0.jpg"},{"name":"Frenzied Output III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703380/dc7fd618818a7e098e37342bcae6d3b31cdbd3e0.jpg"},{"name":"First Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams